  "title": "Air Fryer Hush Puppies",
  "description": "These air fryer hush puppies made with cornmeal and buttermilk are a much lighter alternative to the traditional fritters, which are deep-fried in oil.",
  "authors": [
    "lutzflcat"
  ],
